<section xml:id="sec-normal-calculator">
    <title>Normal Calculator Tool</title>
    <note>
        <title>Zoom Issues</title>
        <p>The author is aware the text and images in this tool are very small. 
            Fortunately, the tool scales well, so you can zoom in to make it easier to read. 
            The author is working on a solution to this issue.
            The recommended zoom level is 200%.</p>
    </note>
    <figure xml:id="fig-normal-calculator-tool">
        <caption>The Normal Calculator Tool created in GeoGebra</caption>
        <interactive geogebra="rjms6u8t" material-width="1391" material-height="586" toolbar="no" reset-icon="yes"/>
    </figure>
</section>